[{"id":"x:14917052148","platform":"x","post_id":"14917052148","published_at":"2010-05-28T16:24:40.000Z","text":"Wishing everyone a Happy Memorial Day Weekend, with a special thought for all the veterans who have done so much for our freedom.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14917052148","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14848387814","platform":"x","post_id":"14848387814","published_at":"2010-05-27T17:24:31.000Z","text":"The Dunes here are amazing, and they're how I learned about geomorphology, which is the study of movement landforms. We've had a great trip","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14848387814","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14785010269","platform":"x","post_id":"14785010269","published_at":"2010-05-26T19:59:58.000Z","text":"The North Coast of Scotland is spectacular--the sea, the sand dunes, the rolling bluffs--we walked the course and it is fantastic.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14785010269","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14764340745","platform":"x","post_id":"14764340745","published_at":"2010-05-26T13:51:37.000Z","text":"Scotland is beautiful. I spent several years looking for the right place, visiting over 200 sites, and this is absolutely the right place!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14764340745","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14716837010","platform":"x","post_id":"14716837010","published_at":"2010-05-26T00:53:23.000Z","text":"RT @CelebApprentice: Who's excited to see Bret on @jayleno tonight? Be sure to tune in and see how he's feeling following his big win!","kind":"repost","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14716837010","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14714818803","platform":"x","post_id":"14714818803","published_at":"2010-05-26T00:10:46.000Z","text":"RT @CelebApprentice: Check out this clip from Bret's appearance on The Today Show as he discusses his current condition: http://bit.ly/a ...","kind":"repost","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14714818803","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14691416579","platform":"x","post_id":"14691416579","published_at":"2010-05-25T17:06:10.000Z","text":"RT @IvankaTrump: Last night I caught up with Bret & Holly backstage. Make sure & Like my Facebook page to hear their final thoughts htt ...","kind":"repost","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14691416579","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14700122010","platform":"x","post_id":"14700122010","published_at":"2010-05-25T15:31:07.000Z","text":"The ratings for the Celebrity Apprentice were fantastic and everyone had a great time. It was a terrific season -- congrats to everyone!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14700122010","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14691984203","platform":"x","post_id":"14691984203","published_at":"2010-05-25T13:16:32.000Z","text":"Ivanka caught up with Bret and Holly backstage. Both Bret and Holly were champions all the way. http://bit.ly/ckmKKU","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14691984203","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14628551705","platform":"x","post_id":"14628551705","published_at":"2010-05-24T15:03:21.000Z","text":"Congratulations to Bret Michaels, the new Celebrity Apprentice. Bret's a true champion, all of us were happy to see him and to see him win!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14628551705","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14428711883","platform":"x","post_id":"14428711883","published_at":"2010-05-21T17:45:44.000Z","text":"RT @IvankaTrump: Go to my new Facebook page & 'Like' it to see exclusive footage! I'll also be filming backstage at the Apprentice Final ...","kind":"repost","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14428711883","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14428698773","platform":"x","post_id":"14428698773","published_at":"2010-05-21T17:45:29.000Z","text":"RT @IvankaTrump: RT @TrumpSoHo: Take a peak @IvankaTrump's FB page http://ow.ly/1NfMt and \\like it\\\" for the inside scoop on @celebappren ...\"","kind":"repost","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14428698773","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14429237277","platform":"x","post_id":"14429237277","published_at":"2010-05-21T13:54:57.000Z","text":"Who's your pick--@bretmichaels or @hollyrpeete ? Vote now on Ivanka's new Facebook page! http://ow.ly/1NfMt","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14429237277","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14371483646","platform":"x","post_id":"14371483646","published_at":"2010-05-20T16:22:40.000Z","text":"The latest update on Bret Michaels is that he's making every effort to attend the live finale of Celebrity Apprentice on Sunday--so tune in!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14371483646","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14364932158","platform":"x","post_id":"14364932158","published_at":"2010-05-20T14:33:59.000Z","text":"Check out Ivanka's new FaceBook page and keep up with what's happening--from The Celebrity Apprentice, to jewlery to free tickets and more..","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14364932158","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14305093521","platform":"x","post_id":"14305093521","published_at":"2010-05-19T16:58:56.000Z","text":"Put this on your calendar: The Celebrity Apprentice live finale is this Sunday at 9 p.m. on NBC. Who will be the next Celebrity Apprentice?","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14305093521","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:14171725850","platform":"x","post_id":"14171725850","published_at":"2010-05-17T16:48:39.000Z","text":"Congratulations to our new Miss USA, the beautiful Rima Fakih. Rima will represent us well at Miss Universe and be a wonderful Miss USA .","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14171725850","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:13936645875","platform":"x","post_id":"13936645875","published_at":"2010-05-13T21:53:45.000Z","text":"Looking forward to the 2010 Miss USA Pageant, Sunday May 16 on NBC, 7 p.m. ET, hosted by Curtis Stone & Natalie Morales live from Las Vegas.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/13936645875","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:13444373897","platform":"x","post_id":"13444373897","published_at":"2010-05-05T19:57:24.000Z","text":"We're all very happy to hear of Bret Michael's progress and send our best wishes for his full recovery.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/13444373897","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:13314652289","platform":"x","post_id":"13314652289","published_at":"2010-05-03T16:43:27.000Z","text":"Providing backstage commentary at the Miss USA Pageant will be comedic mother-daughter duo Joan and Melissa Rivers. A fantastic lineup!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/13314652289","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:13314425371","platform":"x","post_id":"13314425371","published_at":"2010-05-03T16:38:31.000Z","text":"Also appearing on the Miss USA Pageant will be Country Superstar Trace Adkins and Pop Rock Sensation Boys Like Girls...","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/13314425371","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:13314283231","platform":"x","post_id":"13314283231","published_at":"2010-05-03T16:35:23.000Z","text":"Looking forward to the 2010 Miss USA Pageant, Sunday May 16 on NBC, 7 p.m. ET, hosted by Curtis Stone and Natalie Morales.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/13314283231","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"}]